"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_1114552525676893_1677870913491985454_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8cWfUYxLbFYQ7kNvwE6b4AU&_nc_oc=AdqZ-IaXUi9WC_KrGmEKGugOZuP2qJPd88ty4t5GRudi3pW2PKeeIBvrqDT2XZ0gJ_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPE332o9g1bxb5KJG_Eh0CE3lXZy9DVo4emYLzjHrTYdw&oe=6AC52287"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "be a superhuman cover image.png", "id": "942148429692825", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974499_942148433026158_7347930193473508401_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N0rG8kTGx_cQ7kNvwEh9zFM&_nc_oc=AdrmX7kUsBCsk6A_1eggGCXaxPd6NaUcK_geoa_g3gB0I6Q0oFJLN8YqPq79GVpUlPA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMdYbNk4IJ2ySFePuAx7G8lL6AOiE6Q0dV_fOi1rO8dOg&oe=6AC4FAD4"}, "display_name": "Villa", "keywords": ["among", "team", "fly", "social", "design"], "long_description": "* Standups, roadmapping, happy hours, board meetings, design, 1:1s, and offsites that are out of this world and far better than IRL\n* A creativity platform, much like Zoom + Slack in 3D. Our focus is teams, giving tech professionals superpowers to be their best\n* The answer to \u2018videoconference fatigue\u2019 by putting you in thrilling immersive meeting experiences, giving you the tools to interact, co-invent and play\n* A meeting in VR is multiples more effective than IRL meetings with massive screens, and activities that defy physics like drawing in the air\n* Launched with multiple locations around the world. At the heart of each such micro-universe is your Villa, always the same, and always unique as you personalize it to reflect your team and org\u2019s personality and identity\n* Boost in culture, the glue that holds everyone to a common mission which is tricky in remote\n* Improved camaraderie and positive workplace feelings\n* Big CapEx and OpEx savings to your company relative to 